    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσηπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not liable to decay</i> or
				<i>corruption,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fist.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				9.13
			</span></i>(
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				521a1
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλα ἄ.,</span> of
				<i>Acacia tortilis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				25.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.2.8
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέδρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.147
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>undigested,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aff.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			.</div>
